            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Meeting transcripts stop repeating the other side.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.26</h2>
<ul>
  <li>On a call without headphones, your microphone picks up the other person from your speakers. Jarvis used to show those lines twice, once as them and once as you, especially short ones like "Hi" or "Okay". It now recognises and drops the copy, and past meetings show clean too.</li>
  <li>If Jarvis is no longer signed in, it now shows the sign-in screen instead of carrying on quietly without meeting summaries or task updates. Summaries skipped while signed out are written as soon as you sign in.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
